test_cases.then:
then {
    the SUT sends a valid Response for the operations:
        Retrieve Entity Type with Response Status Code set to 200     and
        Retrieve Entity Type with Response body containing an Entity Type Info with expectation body set to file 'types/expectations/entity-type-info-024-01.json' and response body to be checked set to '${response.json()}'
